# Raw reference/seed-source material (subject question banks, syllabi, OCR
# training data) and one-off parsing scripts kept at the repo root for the
# backend reseed workflow. None of this is imported by src/ or copied from
# public/, so Vite never bundles it and it is never served by the deployed
# app — it has no effect on the live site if it isn't in the repo.
/*.txt
/*.xlsx
/*.tex
/*.pdf
/*.traineddata
